Detective Nelson,</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
On September 3, OSP produced the threat-assessment report you wrote on Apri=
l 15, 2026, three weeks after you came to my door. I have read it. You wrot=
e a psychological profile of a stranger you met for four minutes through a =
doorway, and you are the sixth official
 to do some version of the same thing to me. So this letter is addressed to=
 you and copied to all of them, and I am going to lay out what you have all=
 been doing so plainly that no one in any of your buildings can dispute it,=
 deny it, or pretend not to recognize
 it.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
Start with your report. It lists me as &quot;Suspect.&quot; The crime under=
 investigation is &quot;Threat assessment.&quot; There was no crime, and yo=
ur own file shows there was never anything to check. The referral alleged n=
o crime, described no threat, and quoted no statement
 of mine; its stated reason was that my letters now included the Governor. =
Detective Hyde reviewed my archive on March 6 and wrote that nothing stood =
out beyond a grievance with a former employer. If there was ever a right to=
 look, the look ended there, with
 a negative answer. The case file, the Hasty Plan, the satellite photograph=
s of my home, and the visit all came after that answer. You did all of it t=
o a man you already knew was not a threat, and then you labeled that man Su=
spect.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
Now look at what each of you did when you met a person whose documents you =
could not answer.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
A park manager took a bolded line in an email and a poem about the ocean an=
d called them &quot;a pattern of concerning behavior.&quot; He could not na=
me a single thing I had done, so he characterized what I am.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
A program manager promised me a decision that her agency's own records show=
 was already made, then a letter ended my service statewide and permanently=
 for &quot;disparaging public comments,&quot; because what I had said was t=
rue and there was no answer to it except to
 end me.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
An emergency manager took a citizen's letters to his own Director and his o=
wn Governor, the most protected act in American civic life, and sent them t=
o the state police as &quot;situational awareness.&quot; He could not say I=
 had threatened anyone, because I had not,
 so he made my persistence itself the menace.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
The Director of this state's park system was handed a documented record of =
abuse and retaliation by her own staff, and she answered it with this, word=
 for word: &quot;I can see that this has been deeply painful for you.&quot;=
 &quot;I hear the frustration and hurt in your
 words.&quot; &quot;What you believe is right.&quot; &quot;A sense of purpo=
se and healing.&quot; Read those again. A state director looked at evidence=
 and responded by diagnosing the witness. She did not dispute one fact. She=
 has never disputed one fact. She reframed a man's documentation
 of her agency's conduct as his emotional condition, wished him healing, an=
d closed the door. That is not leadership and it is not kindness. It is the=
 practiced maneuver of an institution overwriting a person's reality becaus=
e his reality is proven and hers
 is not.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
A federal agent wrote &quot;multiple veil threats&quot; into an email to an=
other police agency. No one, in eighteen months, has ever produced a statem=
ent of mine to hang those words on, and your own report refutes them. The s=
ame agent, after refusing to give me the names
 of the men who came to my home, wrote that I was &quot;agitated&quot; and =
&quot;rambling.&quot;</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
And you, Detective. &quot;Disgruntled.&quot; &quot;Perceived grievances.&qu=
ot; &quot;A clear and obvious change in attitude and demeanor.&quot; &quot;=
Did not want to listen,&quot; written two paragraphs after your own report =
records me opening my door with the words &quot;I'm listening.&quot;</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
This is one behavior, repeated up an entire chain of state power: when the =
documents cannot be disputed, rewrite the man. Assign him feelings he never=
 reported. Give him motives he does not have. Diagnose his attitude, his de=
meanor, his interior, his healing.
 It is what abusive people do to their victims in kitchens and break rooms,=
 and every one of you did it from a government desk, in official records, t=
o a volunteer who picked up trash for your state for free, whose only docum=
ented act, in your file and mine,
 is telling the truth in public. Grown officials of the State of Oregon wro=
te a police case file about a poem, a website, and a man's tone. Each of yo=
u should read that sentence until you understand it is about you.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
And understand what happens now, because eighteen months of your own files =
already prove it. I document in the moment. Your characterizations face tap=
e: the body camera you announced at my door and your own report tells the r=
eader to consult, the recordings
 I made and published the same days, and a contemporaneous public record th=
at has never once been caught wrong. Every word each of you wrote about my =
mind is now published beside the evidence that answers it. When the tort cl=
aims reach depositions, &quot;disgruntled,&quot;
 &quot;perceived,&quot; &quot;demeanor,&quot; and &quot;rambling&quot; will=
 be read aloud next to that tape, and the men who wrote them will answer fo=
r the difference under oath.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
I do not let people define me. Not a park manager with a note, not a direct=
or with a diagnosis, not a detective with a case file. Every characterizati=
on any of you has ever written about me has been quoted, published, set aga=
inst the record, and left dead on
 the page. That does not change and it does not tire. Write one more word a=
bout my mind, my motives, or my demeanor, in any file, from any desk, and i=
t will meet the same machinery the day I find it.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
Your report contains the only sentences in this entire record that the tape=
 will confirm: no direct threats, no leakage toward violence, no crimes. Yo=
u wrote those too. Think about what it means that the honest sentences and =
the characterizations came from
 the same pen, and which ones your institutions chose to act on.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sa=
ns-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" class=3D"elementToProof">
I ask nothing of any of you. This letter and everything it quotes are part =
of the public record at oprdvolunteerabuse.org.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
